WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.636 --> 00:00:15.927
Danny: You want me to use my imagination to make Chuck and Dave big again?

2
00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:17.168
Brad: Yes.

3
00:00:17.188 --> 00:00:19.490
Danny: What if I refuse?

4
00:00:20.751 --> 00:00:21.671
Brad: I see.

5
00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:25.695
Brad: You don't think your imagination is strong enough, do you?

6
00:00:25.715 --> 00:00:29.898
Danny: Hey, my imagination can do anything!

7
00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:32.200
Brad: Prove it.

8
00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:33.493
Danny: I will.

9
00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:40.617
Danny: Why isn't it working?

10
00:00:40.637 --> 00:00:42.819
Brad: I don't understand.

11
00:00:42.839 --> 00:00:44.720
I was sure it would work.

12
00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.082
Danny: Well, it's not my fault.

13
00:00:47.102 --> 00:00:49.964
Danny: There's nothing wrong with my imagination.

14
00:00:55.287 --> 00:00:56.428
Do you hear something?

15
00:00:56.448 --> 00:00:57.449
Danny: No.

16
00:00:58.209 --> 00:00:59.910
Brad: It's a high frequency noise.

17
00:01:00.871 --> 00:01:02.272
It sounds like chirping.

18
00:01:03.076 --> 00:01:04.837
Danny: It's probably just crickets.

19
00:01:05.877 --> 00:01:08.478
Chuck: Help!

20
00:01:09.099 --> 00:01:13.260
Help! Dave: If anybody can hear us, help!

21
00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:14.981
We are in danger!

22
00:01:15.001 --> 00:01:17.402
Mite Guard: Get moving, slaves!

23
00:01:17.662 --> 00:01:22.704
Brad: What were you imagining when you pulled the trigger?

24
00:01:22.724 --> 00:01:29.467
Danny: I imagined that those mean, stupid, horrible, ugly bullies were big again!

25
00:01:29.487 --> 00:01:34.073
Brad: Danny, you don't really want to help Chuck and Dave, do you?

26
00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:36.135
Danny: No, not really.

27
00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:40.817
Brad: Well, I don't think you can imagine something [n3@that you don't really want.

28
00:01:40.837 --> 00:01:45.219
Danny: You mean the shrink-gun won't work because I don't want them back?

29
00:01:45.239 --> 00:01:47.040
Brad: Exactly!

30
00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.882
Danny: So how will we make them big again?

31
00:01:49.902 --> 00:01:53.144
Brad: The shrink-gun worked once before.

32
00:01:53.784 --> 00:01:54.985
What were you thinking then?

33
00:01:55.005 --> 00:01:58.707
Danny: I was thinking, "I wish these bullies were gone."

34
00:01:58.727 --> 00:02:00.828
Brad: That's it.

35
00:02:01.236 --> 00:02:02.476
I know how to make it work.

36
00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:04.197
Danny: Good.

37
00:02:04.217 --> 00:02:06.097
I'll prove my imagination can do it.

38
00:02:06.117 --> 00:02:10.639
Brad: There!

39
00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:13.439
I just needed to make one small adjustment.

40
00:02:14.019 --> 00:02:15.340
Danny: What did you change?

41
00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.000
Brad: Simple.

42
00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.741
I just needed to double-reverse the polarity.

43
00:02:19.761 --> 00:02:22.862
Brad: This time, think your original thought.

44
00:02:23.562 --> 00:02:25.462
Imagine the bullies disappearing.

45
00:02:25.482 --> 00:02:30.604
Brad: Now the shrink-gun will reverse your thoughts [n3@and reverse-shrink the bullies.

46
00:02:31.092 --> 00:02:33.874
Brad: Thus, the bullies will return to normal size.

47
00:02:33.894 --> 00:02:37.377
Danny: Brad, you're a genius.

48
00:02:37.978 --> 00:02:39.359
Okay. Here's the plan.

49
00:02:39.379 --> 00:02:44.884
Danny: When the bullies are big again, we apologize for [n3@shrinking them and run for our lives.

50
00:02:44.904 --> 00:02:46.024
Danny: Are you ready?

51
00:02:46.044 --> 00:02:47.205
Brad: I'm ready.

52
00:02:47.225 --> 00:02:49.748
Danny: You're sure this will work?

53
00:02:49.788 --> 00:02:51.929
Brad: One hundred percent sure.

54
00:02:51.949 --> 00:02:54.752
Danny: I hope Chuck and Dave aren't too angry
